    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATYO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to offer this magnificent development opportunity to the market within the Gaeltacht village of An Cheathru Rua.Positioned on a mature self-contained site, the property offers significant potential for both a large family home or as a lucrative investment property. The property is presented to a shell & core basis and is presented as a blank canvas for a future occupier. All services are connected which include mains sewage, mains water and electricity.May qualify for various derelict property grants.The property is ideally positioned within the townland of An Bothar Bui which is a mere 500m from the village centre of An Cheathru Rua. All amenities are available within the village which include national and secondary schools, a supermarket, various pubs & restaurants along with the third level affiliated campus of University Galway.For further information, please contact Shane McDonagh of O'Donnellan & Joyce."
      },
